# sentra-shared

Shared logic for Sentra Brain services.

## Structure
- `sentra_shared/domain/`: Entities
- `sentra_shared/core/`: Core models, exceptions, logging
- `sentra_shared/infra/`: Repositories, database services

## Install (editable mode)
```sh
pip install -e ../sentra-shared
```
